{"ts_utc": "2026-05-12T16:14:06.233291Z", "run_id": "20260512_161343_rag_L3_B8_07c130", "seq": 5, "event": "generation.completed", "payload": {"answer": "Parliament discussed governance and public administration, specifically mentioning the need to address vulnerabilities and perpetuate a vicious cycle of poverty [03b07303183d05221dc369a9781177ad93102deb788867827894136d83a6d3aa:28]. They also acknowledged their failure in effectively addressing challenges due to capacity limitations, financial constraints, and lack of political will [03b07303183d05221dc369a9781177ad93102deb788867827894136d83a6d3aa:28].\n\nRegarding security, Parliament discussed the need for national security and mentioned three different Ministries directly connected with security operations: Ministry of Defence, Ministry of the Interior, and Ministry of National Security [a901ffaf2be9df16451dfaac3fa7573e35449dc23a8694d69ef4bc6eb7370e4c:84]. They also mentioned the importance of having a governing body for the Commission on national security, which includes Ministers from various departments [b1388de3c95af6edee92136b7eebce63a484e3894a9f02c36d65c92031bef551:69].\n\nAdditionally, Parliament discussed the need to constitute Committees on Defence and Interior, as well as Security and Intelligence, to navigate security concerns properly [2961970033e18f7755c0bd68acf7cb8be6005f705e805801b547b037d2193797:43].", "answer_sha256": "72d5a03cd90f43d9b7d6f6be415b3160390a5ff7de6d6614fc16cbb47be774d2"}, "prev_hash": "9958bf45a58495275ba7ca4b8e48893d4109757ea9d75675c46adf04d27fa7c1", "event_hash": "bff97d3eb69de16679b9840d747421e5be5ef5b5de5d54a3811ef6d4f2efd318"}
